<div class="em-item-info">
<div class="em-content">
<h3 class="em-item-title"><a href="https://www.access2meds.eu/events/ascertain-final-conference/">ASCERTAIN Final Conference</a></h3>
<div class="em-item-desc">
<p>From Evidence to Access: Rethinking Healthcare Decision-Making in Europe is the motto of our finale ASCERTAIN conference. Join us in Brussels this October.</p>
</div>
